Footage shows Russian Aerospace Forces (VKS) strikes using FAB-500 glide bombs fitted with UMPK guidance kits against the following targets:
• A temporary pontoon crossing near the settlement of Maiaky, Donetsk Oblast;
• A temporary deployment site of Ukraine's 159th Separate Mechanized Brigade in Zakharovka, Kharkiv Oblast;
• A Ukrainian Armed Forces UAV launch site near Rublene, Kharkiv Oblast.
